  "mobileImplementationNotes": [
    "Never log, persist, cache, or include the wallet QR value in analytics or crash reports.",
    "Clear the manual input after a successful scan; retain no token in application state.",
    "Use membershipId from WalletScanSuccess for add-stamp and redeem paths.",
    "Render customer.phone only when non-null and non-empty.",
    "Use progress.canRedeem as the scan-time reward status.",
    "Disable duplicate submissions while a request is in flight.",
    "Treat 401 as a session/authentication failure, 403 as a business access mismatch, and 400 as invalid scan input.",
    "Add-stamp and redeem return updated membership/card data but no wallet refresh queue field.",
    "Do not poll or block UI waiting for Google Wallet after add-stamp or redeem."
